  "interpretation": [
    "Scores are local per-sequence official Score2D, not an aggregate leaderboard submission.",
    "All three use identical frozen online_full_v2 executable, SLAM library and container image.",
    "One official CP Sim3 is applied per selected trajectory. Other maps are not separately aligned or concatenated.",
    "Largest-map selection uses pose count, not ground truth. Full CP and GT denominators remain in force.",
    "Recovered-CP-only conditional score is a diagnostic, not the official score or a forecast of a repaired full run.",
    "Dense pose recall is separate from Score2D. Missing CPs contribute zero official credit.",
    "Long uses factory VRS intrinsics because inherited long calibration was an older independent-focal COLMAP refinement incompatible with the online model.",
    "Therefore long versus the older baseline is not a calibration-only ablation. No short-run optimized calibration was copied into another device/sequence.",
    "This comparison reads saved artifacts and invokes unchanged official metric functions. It runs no estimator, triangulation or new alignment."
  ]
